      "exerciseId": "ex2.1-q1",
      "parts": [
        {
          "partId": "ex2.1-q1-a",
          "solution": {
            "en": "Yearly compound interest is the interest calculated once a year on the principal, where the interest of each year is added to the principal to form the principal for the next year, so that interest is charged on interest. $CI = P\\left[\\left(1+\\dfrac{R}{100}\\right)^T-1\\right]$.",
            "ne": "वार्षिक चक्रवृद्धि ब्याज भनेको सांचोमा वर्षको एक पटक गणना गरिने ब्याज हो, जहाँ हरेक वर्षको ब्याज अर्को वर्षको सांचो बनाउन सांचोमा जोडिन्छ, त्यसैले ब्याजमाथि नै ब्याज लाग्छ। $CI = P\\left[\\left(1+\\dfrac{R}{100}\\right)^T-1\\right]$।"
          }
        },
        {
          "partId": "ex2.1-q1-b",
          "solution": {
            "en": "Half yearly compound interest is the interest calculated twice a year (every 6 months), where each half-year's interest is added to the principal before the next half-year's interest is computed, using half the annual rate for double the number of periods: $CI = P\\left[\\left(1+\\dfrac{R}{200}\\right)^{2T}-1\\right]$.",
            "ne": "अर्धवार्षिक चक्रवृद्धि ब्याज भनेको वर्षमा दुई पटक (प्रत्येक ६ महिनामा) गणना गरिने ब्याज हो, जहाँ अर्को ६ महिनाको ब्याज गणना गर्नुअघि हरेक अर्धवर्षको ब्याज सांचोमा जोडिन्छ, वार्षिक दरको आधा र दोब्बर अवधि प्रयोग गरी: $CI = P\\left[\\left(1+\\dfrac{R}{200}\\right)^{2T}-1\\right]$।"
          }
        },
        {
          "partId": "ex2.1-q1-c",
          "solution": {
            "en": "Quarterly (terminal) compound interest is the interest calculated four times a year (every 3 months), using a quarter of the annual rate for four times the number of periods: $CI = P\\left[\\left(1+\\dfrac{R}{400}\\right)^{4T}-1\\right]$.",
            "ne": "त्रैमासिक चक्रवृद्धि ब्याज भनेको वर्षमा चार पटक (प्रत्येक ३ महिनामा) गणना गरिने ब्याज हो, वार्षिक दरको एक चौथाइ र चार गुणा अवधि प्रयोग गरी: $CI = P\\left[\\left(1+\\dfrac{R}{400}\\right)^{4T}-1\\right]$।"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
